olikraus/u8g2 csrc at dc9fc73ddfc4fc8690afea370780ba322bd0cd79 (the submodule commit FPGA-Companion pins). BSD-2-Clause, see LICENSE. Subset: only the u8g2 core files; display drivers (u8x8_d_*.c, u8g2_d_*.c) and the font collections were left out. sys/bitmap/common/u8x8_d_bitmap.c is included as in the BL616 build. The one font menu.c uses from u8g2_fonts.c is in u8g2_font_helvB08_tr.c, copied verbatim. Nothing else changed.
